speechtext:
Resolved, that towards making good the supply granted! to Her Majesty on account of certain expenses of the public service for the fiscal year ending March 31, 1954, the following sums be granted out of the consolidated revenue fund of Canada, namely:
1.	The sum of $534,871,213.17, being one-sixth of the amount of each of the items set forth in the main estimates for the fiscal year ending March 31, 1954;
2.	The sum of $207,500, being one-quarter of the amount of item 433 of the said estimates;

3.	The sura of $372,512.84, being one-sixth of the amount of items 199, 201, 204, 205 of the said estimates; and
4.	The sum of $2,223,289.17, being one-twelfth of the amount of items 19, 37, 62, 435, 436, 439 of the said estimates; as set forth in the resolution concurred in this day in the committee of supply.
